This program:

- Defines a mutex `integralMutex` and a shared variable `integralValue` to store the integral result 
- Defines three thread functions to compute the integral using different methods
- Creates 10 threads to execute the rectangle method in parallel 
- Waits for all threads to finish 
- Prints the final integral value
- Uses mutexes to synchronize access to the shared variable from multiple threads

